### REST API Testing Interface - Agro-Intelligence System
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:5000/api

### 1. Register User (Farmer Account)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Shiva Kumar",
  "email": "shiva@smartfarm.com",
  "password": "SecurePassword123",
  "role": "farmer",
  "location": "Punjab Regional Farm Alpha",
  "phone": "+91 98765 43210"
}

### 2. Login User
# Note: Cookie will be automatically handled by the HTTP client
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "shiva@smartfarm.com",
  "password": "SecurePassword123"
}

### 3. Get Authenticated User Profile (Requires Login Cookie)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Content-Type: application/json

### 4. Write Soil Telemetry Analysis Record
POST {{baseUrl}}/soil/add
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "moisture": 45.5,
  "ph": 6.2,
  "nitrogen": 85.0,
  "phosphorus": 48.0,
  "potassium": 42.0,
  "temperature": 24.8,
  "ecValue": 1.4
}

### 5. Retrieve Soil Database History Log
GET {{baseUrl}}/soil/all
Content-Type: application/json

### 6. Get Current Weather (Simulated Fallback or OpenWeather)
GET {{baseUrl}}/weather/current?city=Ludhiana
Content-Type: application/json

### 7. Get 7-Day Weather Forecast
GET {{baseUrl}}/weather/forecast?city=Ludhiana
Content-Type: application/json

### 8. Generate Crop Recommendation (AI Module Heuristics)
POST {{baseUrl}}/recommendation/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "moisture": 45.5,
  "ph": 6.2,
  "nitrogen": 85.0,
  "phosphorus": 48.0,
  "potassium": 42.0,
  "temperature": 24.8,
  "humidity": 78.0,
  "rainfall": 180.0
}

### 9. Retrieve Crop Recommendation Logs
GET {{baseUrl}}/recommendation/history
Content-Type: application/json

### 10. IoT Sensor Telemetry Upload Simulation (From ESP32)
POST {{baseUrl}}/sensor/upload
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deviceId": "NODE-01-NPK",
  "sensorType": "IoT Multi-Sensor Field Node",
  "batteryLevel": 88,
  "status": "online",
  "soilData": {
    "moisture": 42.1,
    "ph": 6.4,
    "nitrogen": 92.0,
    "phosphorus": 51.0,
    "potassium": 38.0,
    "temperature": 23.9,
    "ecValue": 1.3
  }
}

### 11. Retrieve IoT Status Inventory Panel
GET {{baseUrl}}/sensor/status
Content-Type: application/json

### 12. Retrieve Disease Analysis Logs
GET {{baseUrl}}/disease/history
Content-Type: application/json

### 13. Logout
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

### 14. Get Marketplace Items Catalog
GET {{baseUrl}}/platform/marketplace
Content-Type: application/json

### 15. List New Crop for Sale on Marketplace
POST {{baseUrl}}/platform/marketplace
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Organic Gold Wheat Grains",
  "description": "Premium sorted post-harvest grains with 12% moisture index.",
  "category": "Crops",
  "price": 18500,
  "quantity": 5,
  "sellerName": "Shiva Kumar"
}

### 16. Book New Agriculture Consultation Session
POST {{baseUrl}}/platform/consultation/book
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "farmerName": "Shiva Kumar",
  "expertName": "Dr. Ramesh Rao",
  "date": "2026-06-01",
  "time": "10:00",
  "queryText": "Leaf spot diagnostic check on tomato foliage crops."
}

### 17. List Consultation Bookings History
GET {{baseUrl}}/platform/consultation
Content-Type: application/json

### 18. Register New Herd Animal in Livestock DB
POST {{baseUrl}}/platform/livestock/add
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "animalType": "Cow (Holstein)",
  "tagNumber": "COW-0492",
  "healthStatus": "Healthy",
  "age": 36,
  "weight": 480,
  "feedSchedule": "Silage + Mineral Mixture",
  "dailyProduction": 18,
  "lastVaccinationDate": "2026-05-10"
}

### 19. Get Registered Livestock Herd Log
GET {{baseUrl}}/platform/livestock
Content-Type: application/json


### 20. Verify User Email (New Feature)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/verify-email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "shiva@smartfarm.com",
  "code": "123456"
}

### 21. Resend Verification Code (New Feature)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/resend-verification
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "shiva@smartfarm.com"
}

### 22. Login User with Role Selection (New Feature)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "shiva@smartfarm.com",
  "password": "SecurePassword123",
  "role": "farmer"
}
